 "remarks": "Welcome to 2437 Bedford Street, Unit C17, where bright, comfortable living meets one of Stamford's most convenient locations. This 2 bedroom, 2 full bathroom ranch style condo features vaulted ceilings, skylights, hardwood floors, and great natural light throughout the main living space. A fireplace adds warmth and character, while the open flow between the living and dining areas makes the home feel inviting and easy to enjoy. The home has been thoughtfully updated over the years, including refinished hardwood floors and wooden stairs in 2022, new light fixtures throughout the kitchen, dining area, hallway, and bathrooms, custom blinds on the main window, a new water heater in 2023, and a new HVAC system in 2026. Wainscoting added in 2026 gives the space an extra finished touch. The spacious primary bedroom includes a private full bathroom, while the second bedroom and additional full bath offer plenty of flexibility for guests or a home office. Step outside onto the private balcony and enjoy morning sunshine and a peaceful outdoor space of your own. The gated community offers security, friendly neighbors, and access to two community pools within walking distance. You are also directly across from shopping and groceries, close to downtown Stamford, Harbor Point, parks, restaurants, nightlife, and waterfront views. The nearby train station also makes commuting and getting into New York City convenient.",
